HISTORY that, lambda=array[*,0,i], flux=array[*,1,i],                           HISTORY uncertainty=array[*,2,i],flag=array[*,3,i].  The zeroth image           HISTORY (array[*,*,0]) contains the data for the aperture in the order          HISTORY closest to the bottom of the detector that is closest to the            HISTORY bottom of the slit (i.e. also closest to the bottom of the              HISTORY detector).  Moving up the detector, the FITS array is filled in         HISTORY with subsequent extraction apertures.  If no orders have been           HISTORY deselected in the extraction process, the contents of the ith           HISTORY aperture in order j can be found as follows:                            HISTORY lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                         HISTORY flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                           HISTORY uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                    HISTORY flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].                           HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY The spectra in the file(s) spectra0025.fits, spectra0026.fits,          HISTORY spectra0027.fits, spectra0028.fits, spectra0029.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0030.fits, spectra0031.fits, spectra0032.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0040.fits, spectra0041.fits, spectra0042.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0043.fits, spectra0044.fits, spectra0045.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0046.fits, spectra0047.fits, spectra0059.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0060.fits, spectra0061.fits, spectra0062.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0063.fits, spectra0064.fits, spectra0065.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0066.fits, spectra0067.fits, spectra0068.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0069.fits, spectra0070.fits were combined using a robust         HISTORY weighted mean with a sigma threshold of 8.  Aperture 1                  